module jev_provenance_change_proposal

input reverse_observation_receipt
input requested_change
input target_scope_digest
input rationale_digest
input review_evidence_digest
input explicit_application_boundary

status UNKNOWN provenance or proposal identity is missing
status DEFERRED receipt is incomplete, mismatched, or not comparable
status PROPOSED provenance-bound change proposal is ready for review
status REJECTED proposal cannot cross its declared scope or boundary

field status
field source_digest
field generated_artifact_digest
field reverse_observation_digest
field target_scope_digest
field rationale_digest
field review_evidence_digest
field first_boundary
field proposal_digest

constraint receipt_precedes_proposal
constraint proposal_is_not_mutation
constraint explicit_application_boundary
constraint target_scope_is_bound
constraint mismatch_is_not_success
constraint no_automatic_authorization
constraint no_provider_invocation
